			"A character hub focused on the most important figures readers are likely to search for first.",
		markdown:
			"Character hub\n\n## The most important character pages to open first\n\nThese pages focus on the figures most likely to matter to a new reader or to appear in related searches. They are not just profile cards. Each one tries to explain symbolic role, emotional function, and where to keep reading next.\n\nRen Zu\n\n### [Who Is Ren Zu? Character Guide](/characters/ren-zu/)\n\nA full character guide to Ren Zu, humanity’s ancestor and the center of the legends.\n\n[Open page](/characters/ren-zu/)\n\nVerdant Great Sun\n\n### [Who Is Verdant Great Sun? | Character Guide](/characters/verdant-great-sun/)\n\nA guide to Ren Zu’s eldest son, his symbolism, and why his arc matters to the work’s early worldview.\n\n[Open page](/characters/verdant-great-sun/)\n\nDesolate Ancient Moon\n\n### [Who Is Desolate Ancient Moon? | Character Guide](/characters/desolate-ancient-moon/)\n\nA guide to Ren Zu’s daughter, sacrifice, rescue, and the emotional force of filial struggle.\n\n[Open page](/characters/desolate-ancient-moon/)\n\nNorthern Dark Ice Soul\n\n### [Who Is Northern Dark Ice Soul? | Character Guide](/characters/northern-dark-ice-soul/)\n\nA guide to one of Ren Zu’s most symbolically charged children: darkness, distance, and difficult purpose.\n\n[Open page](/characters/northern-dark-ice-soul/)\n\nBoundless Forest Samsara\n\n### [Who Is Boundless Forest Samsara? | Character Guide](/characters/boundless-forest-samsara/)\n\nA guide to Boundless Forest Samsara, Ordinary Abyss, scale, horizon, and the politics of limitation.\n\n[Open page](/characters/boundless-forest-samsara/)",
