		markdown:
			"Theme hub\n\n## The ideas people search for most often\n\nThe work stays powerful because its symbols do not stay decorative. They become repeated pressures on the same human problem: how to remain human under suffering, limitation, fate, and the cost of desire.\n\nHope Gu\n\n### [Hope Gu Explained Theme Guide](/themes/hope-gu/)\n\nWhy Hope Gu matters, what it symbolizes, and where it shapes the story most strongly.\n\n[Open page](/themes/hope-gu/)\n\nHope Gu meaning\n\n### [Hope Gu Meaning | Key Moments and Theme Guide](/guides/hope-gu-meaning/)\n\nAn original guide to what Hope Gu means and why readers remember it so strongly.\n\n[Open page](/guides/hope-gu-meaning/)\n\nFate and Freedom\n\n### [Fate and Freedom in The Legends of Ren Zu | Theme Guide](/themes/fate-and-freedom/)\n\nA guide to Fate Gu, rebellion, and the long struggle for freedom.\n\n[Open page](/themes/fate-and-freedom/)\n\nFate Gu\n\n### [Fate Gu Explained Theme Guide](/themes/fate-gu/)\n\nA focused guide to Fate Gu itself: what it represents and why it towers over the work.\n\n[Open page](/themes/fate-gu/)\n\nFreedom Gu\n\n### [Freedom Gu Explained Theme Guide](/themes/freedom-gu/)\n\nA guide to what Freedom Gu means, why it is costly, and why it never stays light for long.\n\n[Open page](/themes/freedom-gu/)\n\nWisdom, Strength, and Self\n\n### [Wisdom, Strength, and Self in The Legends of Ren Zu | Theme Guide](/themes/wisdom-strength-and-self/)\n\nHow Strength Gu, Wisdom Gu, and Self Gu frame growth, identity, and human effort.\n\n[Open page](/themes/wisdom-strength-and-self/)",
